// Status: transport_required (bridges: hol_typedef_matroid)
Theorem matroid_subspace_thm : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall m :e matroid A, forall s c= A, matroid_subspace A m s <-> s c= matroid_set A m /\ forall x :e A, matroid_span A m s x <-> x :e s.
Admitted.

